<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Admin Users is the server-wide user administration window. Open it from File > Admin > Users; it opens as a desktop window you can drag, resize, minimize to the taskbar, and close with its title-bar X. It gathers everything you can do about a person: moderating them, changing their account, and administering their NickServ registration."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_search}>{dgettext("help_features", "Finding a user")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The list reads /admin user list as a point-in-time snapshot — it does not update on its own. Type into Search and tick Online only before choosing Refresh to narrow it. The ban list below reads /admin user banlist under the same search term, so filtering the list filters both."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Enter a nick in the Nick field and choose Info to run /admin user info for a single account."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_ban}>{dgettext("help_features", "Moderation")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Ban, Unban, Kick, Mute and Unmute each take their own nick, so acting on several people in a row never applies an action to a stale selection. Ban accepts an optional reason and duration; Kick accepts a reason; Mute accepts a duration. Leaving a duration blank makes the action permanent."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_shield}>{dgettext("help_features", "Account & roles")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Rename changes a registered nickname. Set role assigns server_operator or removes admin roles by setting user. Only a root administrator can grant the admin role — the option is disabled for everyone else."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "NickServ admin")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "NickServ info reads a registration, Reset password sets a new one without knowing the old, and Drop registration deletes it. Dropping is not reversible."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Access")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Only server administrators and server operators can open this window. Server operators see it read-only: the controls are disabled, and the server refuses the action even if the control is bypassed."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Admin Console")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-admin-user">{dgettext("help_features", "/admin user")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-admin-ns">{dgettext("help_features", "/admin ns")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="channel-permissions">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Channel Permissions")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-desktop">{dgettext("help_features", "Desktop & Windows")}</.help_link>
</p>
